title: "AetherAgents: Delhi–NCT winter smog episode intelligence"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Always-on multi-agent air-quality intelligence service for Delhi–NCT that
  detects acute winter smog episodes, attributes source-class hypotheses with
  cited evidence, and produces GRAP alignment-band advisories with explicit
  uncertainty. Designed for CIRRUS (NCAR) GitOps deployment.
keywords:
  - air quality
  - Delhi
  - NCT
  - PM2.5
  - AQI
  - GRAP
  - multi-agent systems
  - CIRRUS
